# Copy to `.env` and fill in. These are PUBLIC tunnel URLs, NOT secrets — this
# repo never mints LiveKit tokens or holds LiveKit API keys. The external token
# server (run by the brain team) mints room-join JWTs at:
#   GET <base>/token?room=<name>  ->  { "token": "<JWT>", "url": "wss://<project>.livekit.cloud" }

# --- Recommended: dev proxy mode (works even when the token server lacks CORS) ---
# Browser fetches the SAME-ORIGIN /token; the Vite dev proxy (see vite.config.ts)
# relays it to TOKEN_UPSTREAM server-to-server, so CORS never applies.
VITE_TOKEN_ENDPOINT="/"
# Upstream token server the proxy forwards to. Update when the ngrok tunnel rotates.
TOKEN_UPSTREAM="https://ginger-monoatomic-thu.ngrok-free.dev"

# Room name the game joins (sent as ?room=<name>). MUST match the room the agent
# is dispatched into. Optional — defaults to "test-room" if unset.
VITE_VOICE_ROOM="test-room"

# --- Alternative: direct mode (ONLY if the token server sends CORS headers) ---
# Point the browser straight at the token server's base URL and leave TOKEN_UPSTREAM
# unset so the proxy stays off:
# VITE_TOKEN_ENDPOINT="https://ginger-monoatomic-thu.ngrok-free.dev"
